---
import WysDecor from './WysDecor.astro';
import WysPhoto from './WysPhoto.astro';
import {examples} from '../data/wys.js';
---
<section class="wys-wrap wys-section">
 <div class="wx-centered"><p class="wys-label">Before the first post</p><h2>Give your shopping idea<br/><em>a place to start.</em></h2><p>The Pretty Wicked brief keeps the theme, selected products, content plan and next steps together.</p></div>
 <div class="wx-worksheet"><WysPhoto photo={examples[0].photos[0]} treatment="double" label="Pretty Wicked / the starting point"/><div class="wx-worksheet-paper"><div class="wz-notebook-binding" aria-hidden="true">{Array.from({length:6}).map(()=><span/>)}</div><header class="wz-brief-heading"><div><span class="wx-file-label">PRETTY WICKED / LOOK BRIEF</span><h3>Your idea, all together.</h3></div><WysDecor class="wz-brief-flower"/></header><dl><div><dt>Theme & category</dt><dd>Pink Halloween · Home Decor · Entryway</dd></div><div><dt>Selected products</dt><dd>Five selected types: pumpkins, gauze, string lights, bats and LED tea lights.</dd></div><div><dt>Three styling views</dt><dd>Selected pieces together, a styled console, then the lifestyle scene photographed from the porch.</dd></div><div><dt>Content to create</dt><dd>3 photos, 3 Pins, 3 carousel slides, 1 article, product notes and channel copy.</dd></div><div><dt>Where it leads</dt><dd>The Pink Halloween Entryway Decor article brings the look together for readers. Shopping destinations are checked before sharing.</dd></div><div><dt>What to check next</dt><dd>Verify the selected products and exact shopping destinations before any social publishing.</dd></div></dl><div class="wx-checkpoint"><b>Keep your place.</b><p>Keep your selected products, photographs and writing together, so you can return to the idea without starting from scratch.</p></div></div></div>
</section>
